<title>ITALY: Italy cabinet to meet on mini-budget Thursday.</title>
<headline>Italy cabinet to meet on mini-budget Thursday.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The cabinet of Prime Minister Romano Prodi will meet at 0830 on Thursday to discuss a cost-cutting mini-budget, Prodi's office said in a statement.</p>
</text>
